// Dedushka, the integrated demo: he rises from dormancy west of Morton (Everon),
// is seen first as a furnace glow from far out on the bay, walks in through the
// houses, roars, takes the garrison's fire (scripted: no weapon is fired),
// straightens and cuts the town with the beam, stands spent among the fires and
// walks out into the sea. Standalone experiment mission (not a Guerrilla
// template). The garrison and the townspeople are placed here, not made by
// script, because only a group loaded from a mission has its flee strength
// computed (the roar feature's notes). Everyone is EAST or civilian and the
// creature is held captive, so nobody has anyone to shoot at. The unit
// placement is the brain feature's DedDemo.Eden, plus a reserve platoon of four
// T-80s on the road east of the town (kjdR1..4: the heavy force of the "kill"
// beat and of the live-fire take); init.sqs makes the creature.
